(F5 T2 V5: element_dof (6.421) and element_intpnt_dof (6.437) of a unit
 quad4 with the 1-point rule (group_integration_points -minimal): the
 single point value at every node for the stresses (5.1282 0.8547 0
 -0.8547 0 1.2821), velx/vely the node values; element_intpnt_dof has
 10 values (1 point, not padded). Source: Professional 02-08-2026 probe p1
 (same input); every slot equal within 1e-11 except disx/disy
 (Professional 0, GNU the point displacement; class B
 ELEMENT-DOF-DISPLACEMENT). Tolerance 1e-5 of the largest value.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
group_integration_points 0 -minimal
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 3 3 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 1 4 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.01
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
